  "name": "doodle-icons (LaTeX package, CTAN)",
  "summary": "LaTeX package by Cédric Pierquet that exposes the 439 hand-drawn Doodle Icons (by Khushmeen Sidhu) as commands, e.g. \\doodleicon{bottle}. Icons are PDF images from SVG, take the current text colour and scale via a height key; works with pdfLaTeX, LuaLaTeX and XeLaTeX. Included in TeX Live.",
