  "procedure": [
    "With TeX Live: tlmgr install doodle-icons (or update your distribution).",
    "Manual: open https://ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/doodle-icons and download the package zip (1.7 MB; mirrors.ctan.org/macros/latex/contrib/doodle-icons.zip redirects to a nearby mirror).",
    "Put doodle-icons.sty and doodleicons-all.pdf in your local texmf tree and run texhash / mktexlsr.",
    "Add \\usepackage{doodle-icons} and use \\doodleicon[height=2em]{name}."
